<template>
  <div class="page">
    <h1 class="pdx-txt-title">Menu</h1>
    <p class="pdx-txt-body pdx-ink-muted intro">
      <code>&lt;pdx-menu&gt;</code> — a menu drawn in place from an <code>items</code> array: icons, shortcuts,
      checkbox and radio items, submenus, keyboard navigation and type-ahead. It shows while <code>open</code> is set,
      and takes focus when it opens. Here each one opens from a button; Escape or a choice closes it and returns focus.
      For a ready-made button menu, see <strong>DropdownMenu</strong>; for a menu bar, <strong>Menubar</strong>.
    </p>

    <!-- ═══ Basic ═══ -->
    <pdx-demo-comp-menu-basic class="demo-section"></pdx-demo-comp-menu-basic>

